				<main id="fsPageContent" class="fsPageContent">
							<h1 class="fsPageTitle">Board of Trustees </h1>




							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_9595" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_9596"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_17677" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>Members of the Sequoia Union High School District Board of Trustees are elected by the general population. Board members are elected to four-year terms. Student Advisory Council (SAC) members rotate to attend Board Meetings as Student Board Members and serve a one-year term.</p>

<p><a data-page-name="Election Area Border Map" href="/fs/pages/4185" target="_blank"><em><span class="button-4">Election Area Map</span></em></a></p>

<p><em><strong>The public may email all board members via&nbsp;<a href="javascript:ccms_O('1513&amp;710&amp;989&amp;416&amp;464&amp;542&amp;58&amp;142&amp;542&amp;710&amp;1529&amp;776&amp;361&amp;1507&amp;279&amp;524&amp;1520&amp;542&amp;1529&amp;1109', 1711, 1083)" onblur="return(status_msg(''));" onfocus="return(status_msg(this.title));" onmouseout="return(status_msg(''));" onmouseover="return(status_msg(this.title));" target="_self">board@seq.org</a>&nbsp;</strong></em><span class="callout-text">The role of the school board is to ensure that school districts are responsive to the values, beliefs and priorities of their communities. Boards fulfill this role by performing five major responsibilities:</span></p>

<ul>
	<li>Setting direction</li>
	<li>Establishing an effective and efficient structure</li>
	<li>Providing support</li>
	<li>Ensuring accountability</li>
	<li>Providing community leadership as advocates for children, the school district and public schools</li>
</ul>

<p style="text-align: right;"><em>-- California School Boards Association</em></p>

<p style="text-align: right;">&nbsp;</p>

<p><a href="https://seq-org.community.highbond.com/portal/" target="_blank"><em><strong><span class="button-4">Board Agenda</span></strong></em></a></p>

<p><a href="https://simbli.eboardsolutions.com/Policy/PolicyListing.aspx?S=36030459&amp;ptid=amIgTZiB9plushNjl6WXhfiOQ==" target="_blank"><em><strong><span class="button-4">Board Policies</span></strong></em></a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSlideshow fsSlideshowHorizontal" id="fsEl_23637" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="23637" data-source-page-id="2079" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<h3 class="fsResourceCollectionName">School Board Visits to Schools</h3><div class="fsResourceCollectionDescription fsDescription">SUHSD Board members regularly visit our schools. Enjoy these photos of trustees getting to know students and staff on campuses!</div><div class="fsElementSlideshow" data-adaptive-height="true" data-arrows="true" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-speed="3000" data-dots="true" data-fade="false" data-slides-to-show="1" data-slideshow-item-label="Resource item" data-slideshow-label="" data-tabbable-slides="false" data-vertical="false"><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><a class="fsResourceLink" data-permitted-user="true" data-preview="false" data-resource-collection-id="22" data-resource-title="16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg" data-resource-type="Image" data-resource-uuid="fdc20a77-a595-44e7-b378-5905495e4660" href="#"><picture><img alt="Trustees visit Carlmont" data-aspect-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782439099/seqorg1/txs5l4fqb3reubsmwqdn/16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782439099/seqorg1/txs5l4fqb3reubsmwqdn/16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782439099/seqorg1/txs5l4fqb3reubsmwqdn/16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1782439099/seqorg1/txs5l4fqb3reubsmwqdn/16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1782439099/seqorg1/txs5l4fqb3reubsmwqdn/16B690FB-4783-456D-AEE2-5B053D059F681.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_au