				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><span style="font-size:22px;"><strong>SUHSD&#39;s Board of Trustees</strong></span></p>

<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="Photo Trustee Amy Koo" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_6/v1782425851/seqorg1/vrppxmbf8juq6gztr7va/AmyKoo.jpg%22,%22width%22:2200}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="AmyKoo.jpg" data-resource-uuid="23dbc16e-ae04-4ad6-aba4-fe5cd3d1492f" loading="lazy" src="" width="132" /></picture></figure>
</div>

<p><strong>Amy Koo, President, Trustee Area A (Term Expires 2026)</strong></p>

<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782426769/fhgt3xgvkyanh8vf1ity/2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782426769/fhgt3xgvkyanh8vf1ity/2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782426769/fhgt3xgvkyanh8vf1ity/2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1782426769/fhgt3xgvkyanh8vf1ity/2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1782426769/fhgt3xgvkyanh8vf1ity/2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg%22,%22width%22:1500}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="2_RichGinnPhoto-Jan2024.jpg" data-resource-uuid="0fea2d90-c324-4d39-bcf3-a9eb21adcb79" loading="lazy" role="presentation" src="" width="135" /></picture></figure>
</div>

<p><strong>Rich Ginn, Vice President/Clerk, Trustee Area C (Term Expires 2028)</strong></p>

<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="Photo of Trustee Maria Cruz" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_6/v1782434433/seqorg1/mlv077qmihp9wtykbq95/TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg%22,%22width%22:2200}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="TrusteeMariaElenaCruz.jpg" data-resource-uuid="d8bcf778-eec6-4a32-a7da-778ec5aa90a7" loading="lazy" src="" width="133" /></picture></figure>
</div>

<p><strong><img alt="" role="presentation" src="" width="256" />Trustee Dr. Maria E. Cruz, Trustee Area E (Term Expires 2028)</strong></p>

<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="Photo of Trustee Sathvik Nori" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_6/v1782434377/seqorg1/kclt1t8zlwffvrepnnq7/TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg%22,%22width%22:2200}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="TrusteeSathvikNoricopy.jpg" data-resource-uuid="a735d56f-7574-4898-a2d6-2066c869e61e" loading="lazy" src="" width="143" /></picture></figure>
</div>

<p><strong>Trustee Sathvik Nori, Trustee Area D (Term Expires 2026)Trustee </strong></p>

<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="Photo of trustee Mary Beth Thompson" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782434513/seqorg1/vuz5vv5ncsvwraybo4hw/TrusteeMaryBethThompson.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1782434513/seqorg1/vuz5vv5ncsvwraybo4hw/TrusteeMaryBethThompson.jpg%22,%22width%22:481}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="TrusteeMaryBethThompson.jpg" data-resource-uuid="475f7bc9-a3cd-4ea4-93d3-ba24b9ff145c" loading="lazy" src="" width="148" /></picture></figure>
